cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Retinal Selective Prediction: Calibrated Uncertainty and Selective Classification for Diabetic Retinopathy Screening"
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Khan
    given-names: Shahnawaz
    alias: ShahnawazKakarh
    website: "https://www.skakarh.com"
